safety: ready, identifies today 1
safety: read-only: You do not have permission to send messages here. / You do not have permission to send messages here.
safety: blocked: You blocked this person: unblock them in Discord to write here.
safety: slowmode: first '', second 'Slowmode: you can send again in 30 s.', countdown true
